<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 303 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 303 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 303.54  million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 552.41 million rand on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
